  "core_relation": {
    "sentence": "The paper's argument is that scholarly citation practice—not the scholar's personal label—is what determines where a scholar stands on the resurrection, so the conclusion depends jointly on the ratio of critical citations to believing citations, the early dating of the creeds, and the charitable interpretation of context.",
