      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "S_eff",
      "plays_role": "Misquotation, decontextualization, and scholarly noise that lower the coherence of the argument; the paper treats these as the entropy that must be overcome.",
      "quote": "They just want to go off. [S322]",
      "fit": "analogous"
    },
    {
      "slot": "T",
      "plays_role": "The temporal distance between Jesus's death and the earliest creeds (30-50 AD) is the key variable that makes the testimony reliable.",
      "quote": "33 to 48 is only 15 years. That's really But if you go with me with I'd say 30 to 50, that's 20 years. That's earlier than Mark, earlier in all the gospels. [S350-S352]",
